ary equation is therefore\n\n$$\n{\\lambda }^{2}+81=0.\n$$\n\nThe auxiliary equation has pure imaginary roots:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\lambda }^{2}+81 & =0 \\\\ {\\lambda }^{2} & =-81 \\\\ \\lambda  & =\\pm 9\\text{i}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the general solution to the differential equation is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}y=P\\operatorname{cos}⁡(9x)+Q\\operatorname{sin}⁡(9x).\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139534531 17592186045417 true] [17592186424422 1068 #edb/ref 17592186424415 13194139534531 17592186045417 true] [17592186424422 1069 "q-130169" 13194139534531 17592186045417 true] [17592186424422 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045485 13194139534531 17592186045417 true] [17592186424422 1071 "Find the general solution to the equation\n\n$$\n\\frac{{\\text{d}}^{2}y}{\\text{d}{x}^{2}}+4\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}+20y=0.\n$$" 13194139534531 17592186045417 true] [17592186424422 1072 #uuid "a7ffe364-7a92-504c-8ec6-763abcbb5581" 13194139534531 17592186045417 true] [17592186424422 1074 "Let $y={e}^{\\lambda x}.$ Differentiating $y$ with respect to $x$ gives\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}=\\lambda {e}^{\\lambda x},\\,\\frac{{\\text{d}}^{2}y}{\\text{d}{x}^{2}}={\\lambda }^{2}{e}^{\\lambda x}.\n$$\n\nSubstituting the above into our differential equation gives \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\lambda }^{2}{e}^{\\lambda x}+4\\lambda {e}^{\\lambda x}+20{e}^{\\lambda x} & =0 \\\\ {e}^{\\lambda x}({\\lambda }^{2}+4\\lambda +20) & =0.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe auxiliary equation is therefore\n\n$$\n{\\lambda }^{2}+4\\lambda +20=0.\n$$\n\nThe auxiliary equation can be solved by completing the square:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\lambda }^{2}+4\\lambda +20 & =0 \\\\ ({\\lambda }^{2}+4\\lambda +4)-4+20 & =0 \\\\ (\\lambda +2)^{2}+16 & =0 \\\\ (\\lambda +2)^{2} & =-16 \\\\ \\lambda +2 & =\\pm 4\\text{i} \\\\ \\lambda  & =-2\\pm 4\\text{i}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the general solution to the differential equation is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}y & ={e}^{-2x}(P\\operatorname{cos}⁡4x+Q\\operatorname{sin}⁡4x).\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139534531 17592186045417 true]] :edb/tempids {"answer-03245522-0fe0-529f-b451-6abe8b80f779" 17592186424381 "answer-07b4249e-69dd-59cf-b52b-1c6c4a33e356" 17592186424382 "answer-0c0d77c8-7efa-509f-bef6-82baddb279d6" 17592186424383 "answer-11fa98b4-5ce7-562e-8556-f0c5fde17981" 17592186424384 "answer-1513401a-e1ba-5664-b3cf-95e373800e1e" 17592186424385 "answer-17a24000-d1ae-5136-a384-a4ac9e0ce633" 17592186424386 "answer-1b17692c-c9e6-5fb9-b683-710c751d71eb" 17592186424387 "answer-246b2565-637f-5292-abfa-d2862a24940b" 17592186424388 "answer-3039ea89-084f-5591-9fca-1787fe1eb56d" 17592186424389 "answer-372decf5-07c1-53da-bc75-d9a5d1ca2af2" 17592186424390 "answer-3c8c3852-79f6-52a8-bf76-04d14a086970" 17592186424391 "answer-3e1e64c8-d790-53a7-bc7e-bbf555d4681b" 17592186424392 "answer-448487a5-9552-5c98-a142-dc48b8aa610f" 17592186424393 "answer-4a87e083-8bfc-5269-80d1-c0f3cccf05ad" 17592186424394 "answer-4dcba3b3-b484-591b-9199-dbe512146957" 17592186424395 "answer-579b2912-410b-55c0-b52c-737d3298d055" 17592186424396 "answer-58f5d98e-6fb6-528b-b0ee-2573b379c1a2" 17592186424397 "answer-5aca1eff-3ec7-558c-b8b7-98e8fbd1724d" 17592186424398 "answer-60a91155-f0af-53ce-9e9e-3353b022d470" 17592186424399 "answer-622d3756-d700-5d84-8d8b-60c8973afaed" 17592186424400 "answer-6ccdaae6-8946-5a17-88e5-edb6ce7cbfa8" 17592186424401 "answer-70d70171-451c-5304-897d-4e4efdb95d05" 17592186424402 "answer-769edc59-752e-5e12-8330-8391cd08a5e2" 17592186424403 "answer-7b8c966b-6123-5761-8d43-445de358d1fb" 17592186424404 "answer-81bc7a0f-e18c-5f02-830e-17220310bc9f" 17592186424405 "answer-b3ef9807-00e5-5ea2-a26c-7dfdf73f111b" 17592186424406 "answer-b774558a-559a-5988-8403-8737cd918d6c" 17592186424407 "answer-c972df8a-ed3b-5895-a3ef-2a61194b7a3c" 17592186424408 "answer-f13d0b8d-e943-5792-a3b5-b8da7091ae7b" 17592186424409 "answer-f3b188bb-b260-50c5-829b-55f980ff4f25" 17592186424410 "answer-field-2d07ff77-a6c4-5f49-aa6e-272568f4eaad" 17592186424411 "answer-field-9b5fd536